{"learnerLanguage":"pt","level":"B2","objectivesMet":["Reschedule the appointment","Explain your symptoms","Ask about the cost"],"scenario":{"characterName":"Linda","objectives":["Reschedule the appointment","Explain your symptoms","Ask about the cost"],"situation":"Você tem uma consulta na quinta, mas surgiu um compromisso. Ligue para a recepcionista, Linda, para remarcar e avisar como está.","title":"Remarcar uma consulta"},"targetLanguage":"en","turns":[{"speaker":"character","text":"Good morning, Riverside Clinic, this is Linda speaking. How can I help you?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Hi Linda, I have an appointment with Doctor Patel on Thursday at ten, but something came up at work and I was wondering if I could move it to Friday."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Let me check. Friday we have 11:30 or 3 p.m. Which works better?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Eleven thirty would be ideal, thanks. Also, I should mention that the cough has gotten worse. I've had it for about two weeks now."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Thanks for letting me know, I'll add that to your file. Anything else?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Yes, actually. Could you tell me how much costs the consultation if my insurance doesn't cover it?"},{"speaker":"character","text":"Without insurance it's one hundred and fifty dollars."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Okay, that's fine. I'll bring my insurance card anyway, just in case. Thanks so much for your help."}]}